+//! Automatic microphone level control, entirely off the audio real-time thread.
 //!
-//! It reuses three parts the product already ships:
-//! - [`crate::gain_policy::GainPolicy`] — the reviewed dB-domain controller
-//!   (target level, deadband, rise/fall limiting, request/ACK, manual hold).
-//! - [`crate::services::audio_monitor`] — the off-RT `pw-cat` level monitor
-//!   (`rms_db`/`peak_db` per hop of the default source).
-//! - [`crate::services::pipewire::sources`] — `wpctl` get/set volume.
-//!
