-//! in LADSPA plugins), so the whole controller runs in one off-RT thread at
-//! ~20 Hz, fed by the monitor. The actuated volume is the PipeWire node volume
-//! (the same one the GUI's manual mic slider drives), converted to/from dB with
-//! PipeWire's cubic mixer curve. v1 acts on hardware/source volume only; the
-//! policy's digital-gain suggestion is not applied to the chain.
